=670  \\$aBarcala de Moyano, Graciela G.; Voena, Cristina. Tesauro de Historia argentina, 2004:$b(Batalla de Curupaity)
=670  \\$aLibrary of Congress Authorities, 03 mayo 2016:$bcat. aut. (Curupaity, Battle of, Curupayty, Ñeembucú, Paraguay, 1866)
