=670  \\$aDirección General de Bibliotecas, UNAM, 18 abr. 2016:$bcat. aut. Librunam (Batalla de Tsushima, 1905)
=670  \\$aLibrary of Congress Authorities, 18 abr. 2016:$bcat. aut. (Tsushima, Battle of, 1905)
