=670  \\$aBiblioteca Nacional de España, 24 feb. 2021:$bcat. aut. (Música--Andes (Región))
=670  \\$aLibrary of Congress Authorities, 24 feb. 2021:$bcat. aut. (Popular music--Andes Region)
