=550  \\$aNaturalismo en la literatura
=670  \\$aBiblioteca Nacional de España, 14 oct. 2024:$bcat. aut. (Realismo--En el arte)
=670  \\$aBibliothèque Nationale de France, 14 oct. 2024:$bcat. aut. RAMEAU (Réalité--Dans l'art)
=670  \\$aLibrary of Congress Authorities, 14 oct. 2024:$bcat. aut. (Realism in art)
